WEBVTT

00:07:59.272 --> 00:08:00.390
Veľmi dobre.

00:08:00.390 --> 00:08:02.132
Teraz rozcvičíme pery.

00:08:02.132 --> 00:08:04.484
Urobíme: ba, ba, ba, ba, ba...

00:08:06.264 --> 00:08:07.436
Výborne.

00:08:07.436 --> 00:08:10.876
A teraz: brrrrrrrr...

00:08:10.876 --> 00:08:12.326
Ako keď ste boli deti.

00:08:12.326 --> 00:08:14.853
Cítite, ako vám pery ožívajú.


00:08:14.853 --> 00:08:16.428
Ďalej precvičíme jazyk

00:08:16.428 --> 00:08:20.850
s prehnaným: la, la, la, la, la, la, la.

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:22.880
Krásne. Fakt vám to začína ísť.

00:08:22.880 --> 00:08:25.955
A potom rolujte „r“. 
Rrrrrrrrr.

00:08:25.955 --> 00:08:28.171
Pre jazyk je to ako šampanské.

00:08:28.171 --> 00:08:30.491
Ak chcem len jeden cvik, bude to tento: